Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.88,0:00:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can't have summer vacation without...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.71,0:00:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,the beach!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.88,0:00:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good thing we took a spontaneous trip\Nto this deserted island!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.75,0:00:14.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,U-uh, sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.00,0:00:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But the swimsuit that the boss\Nbrought for me is...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.71,0:00:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could probaby win a\Nsexual harassment case with it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.75,0:00:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,On second thought, I'm going to go change-
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.38,0:00:26.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay, the ocean!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.04,0:00:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,And what lovely weather! How delightful!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.75,0:00:32.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Laika can't wait to munch on\Nthe fish she catches.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.63,0:00:34.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Boss Lady.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.04,0:00:38.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have my sincerest gratitude for not only\Nlooking after my niece and her friends,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.13,0:00:40.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,but also selecting swimwear for us.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.25,0:00:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it! I invited you here, after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.50,0:00:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alright, everyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.88,0:00:48.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have until the boat picks us up,\Nso let's party!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.13,0:00:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.33,0:02:00.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why did I have to come...?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.50,0:02:01.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.96,0:02:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dragging me to a deserted island and\Nforcing me to wear this obscene outfit...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.38,0:02:09.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely unaccept-
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.13,0:02:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what the hell are you wearing?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.58,0:02:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're a creep!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.00,0:02:16.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,A creep?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.46,0:02:18.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's always griping about something...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.50,0:02:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,We captured the satyr when she\Nsnuck into the human's place,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.33,0:02:24.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,but maybe we shouldn't have brought her...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.92,0:02:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Staaaaare...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.83,0:02:33.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,...just do it...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.08,0:02:34.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.04,0:02:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you're going to laugh,\Njust get it over with!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.21,0:02:40.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey there, little one.\NWanna build a sandcastle with Mommy?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.96,0:02:42.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm in hell...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.50,0:02:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh my! Isn't playing in the sand wonderful?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.63,0:02:47.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a pro at it, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.71,0:02:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-back off, you two!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.17,0:02:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,She only needs one mom and it's ME!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.29,0:02:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I'm cut out to be a mother...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.29,0:02:56.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't really care either way.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.42,0:02:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Craaab...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.92,0:03:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's safe to jump...?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.29,0:03:04.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Relax, we'll be fine!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.17,0:03:05.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It looks like fun!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.38,0:03:07.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Check this out! I'll go first!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.79,0:03:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, but Miss Merrow... I thought\Nyou couldn't swim in human f-
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look out below!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.13,0:03:15.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's in trouble!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.33,0:03:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to save y-
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.88,0:03:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never learned to swim either...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.75,0:03:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! Then why would you jump?!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.08,0:03:25.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Doggie, what should we-
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.71,0:03:37.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Floaty...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.25,0:03:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, that feels fantastic...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.00,0:03:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Naoe, you're so skilled with your hands...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.75,0:03:51.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,A creep...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.08,0:03:52.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's a creep among us...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.17,0:03:57.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noisy two-legged miscreants...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.79,0:04:00.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will purge them from my ocean!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.42,0:04:03.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.92,0:04:07.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,A stand up paddle board,\Nalso known as a "SUP."
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.33,0:04:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's an aquatic sport enjoyed by\Nadults and children alike!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.42,0:04:14.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have to stand on the board\Nand maintain your balance,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.33,0:04:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,which means you get a full-body workout.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.42,0:04:20.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Since it's a steady surface,\Nyou can even do yoga on top of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.79,0:04:22.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seems simple enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.54,0:04:25.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Must be a nice board if it doesn't sink\Nunder the weight of Elfatty.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.88,0:04:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.46,0:04:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,C-calm down, ladies!\NOur feet can touch the bottom here!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.38,0:04:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't drag me down too, humungo-butt!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.13,0:04:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up! I wasn't anywhere near you!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.38,0:04:41.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,There must be something wrong with my board!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.04,0:04:42.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It just flipped over for no reason!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.88,0:04:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it's actually pretty tough\Nto fall off like that...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.83,0:04:47.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Auntie!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.33,0:04:55.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're busy drownin' while they're\Nout there havin' a grand old time.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.83,0:04:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind giving it a try...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mobile home crab...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.04,0:05:02.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Squid?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.46,0:05:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Doggie?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.29,0:05:07.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The heck happened?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.29,0:05:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Dog?! Are you alright?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.04,0:05:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is this?! A booby trap?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling someone\Nwants to ruin our day...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Miss Pig?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.04,0:05:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That scared me...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.58,0:05:24.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,She freed herself?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.75,0:05:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, where's your swimsuit?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.42,0:05:27.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It slipped off.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.96,0:05:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Help us, Miss Dog!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.54,0:05:31.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Save Miss Pig first!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.88,0:05:37.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the most effective approach for\Ndisposing of unwanted pests...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.13,0:05:40.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wear them down with small inconveniences!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.71,0:05:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The slow burn method is insquidious!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.50,0:05:45.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,For my next victim...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.50,0:05:45.38,Q3,,0,0,0,,Floaty, floaty...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.71,0:05:48.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\Nwhat's a dragon doing here...?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.83,0:05:49.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.13,0:05:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dragon or not, it is I who\Nreigns supreme in the water!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.58,0:06:04.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Moms are strong!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.71,0:06:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are we still doing this...?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.58,0:06:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The last one standing inside this circle\Nwill be crowned the ultimate mom!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.21,0:06:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,A wrestling match between the three of us?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.58,0:06:15.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can win...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.21,0:06:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in being a mother...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.00,0:06:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,but it's time we settle this feud\Nonce and for all.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.17,0:06:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.54,0:06:27.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.13,0:06:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aren'tcha gonna fight?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.88,0:06:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd die if I tried to take on\Na couple of giants.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.67,0:06:40.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,So they're giants, not just big-boned...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.96,0:06:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,As forsquidable as I am,\Nif I got caught up in their duel on land...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.58,0:06:49.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.04,0:06:51.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,No... I am an emperor!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.79,0:06:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Unrelenting! Undaunted! Undefeated!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.58,0:06:58.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, ladies!\NLet's get the barbeque started!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.21,0:07:04.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Temporary truce.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.79,0:07:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.04,0:07:12.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus-Sized Elf!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.92,0:07:16.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a spread!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.25,0:07:18.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,So many ingredients to choose from.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.04,0:07:19.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,And they're all fresh.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks tasty...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.63,0:07:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Squid is yet another great option\Nwhen you're watching your weight.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.75,0:07:26.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But the boss fell asleep,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.33,0:07:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,and she was supposed to slice it up...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.33,0:07:28.17,Q3,,0,0,0,,Oh jeez... Stop that, Naoe...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, she did drink quite a bit...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.58,Q3,,0,0,0,,Oh jeez... Stop that, Naoe...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.58,0:07:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do we do now...?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not to fret, human!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.46,0:07:34.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elfuda-
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.46,0:07:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I made my own French fries just in case\Nsomething like this happened!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.96,0:07:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seems like it's finally my time to shine!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.17,0:07:46.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Preparing squid is a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.75,0:07:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.92,0:07:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine, whatever. But, uh...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.75,0:07:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your swimsuit.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.75,0:07:52.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.04,0:07:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,NOOOOO!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.96,0:08:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that a...?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.67,0:08:04.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won't abide treating\Nmy brethren like garbage!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.46,0:08:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,An earthquake?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.63,0:08:08.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Enough squidding around!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.46,0:08:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,They'll pay for tresspassing in my ocean!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.29,0:08:12.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,The hell is that?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.38,0:08:16.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that a kraken?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.21,0:08:17.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,A kraken...?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.58,0:08:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,A giant squid, and it's extremely territorial.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.67,0:08:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd heard it was ousted as king of the seas,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.58,0:08:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I wasn't aware it had migrated\Nto the human world...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.42,0:08:28.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I wasn't "ousted"!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.54,0:08:30.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I simply had a cold that day!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.58,0:08:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I would've blown those\Nsquidiots out of the water!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.71,0:08:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a pretty lame excuse...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.33,0:08:38.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not an excuse, it's the TRUTH!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.25,0:08:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You dare defy me?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Quit your yapping!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.25,0:08:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Potato Strike!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.25,0:08:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Foolish creature.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.83,0:08:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You think you can best me?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.58,0:08:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tsk, I can't get close enough...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.79,0:08:52.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-we're dead meat!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.08,0:08:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,No need to panic, human.\NWitness our combat prowess in action.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.63,0:08:57.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait a second...!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.79,0:09:00.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We need a replacement squid\Nfor the barbeque, don't we?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.38,0:09:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.67,0:09:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whichever of us defeats the kraken\Nis her REAL mom!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.21,0:09:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't I get a say in this?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.79,0:09:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hoist it onto the beach!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.63,0:09:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pull! Pull! Pull! Pull!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.17,0:09:13.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmph, how pathetic...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.75,0:09:16.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pull! Pull! Pull! Pull!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.75,0:09:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks yummy...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.92,0:09:22.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't eat me!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Enchantment!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.50,0:09:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hyaaaaa!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.75,0:09:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mommy Power!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.42,0:09:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's useless! Futile!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.75,0:09:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your attacks are mere child's play\Nto the Almighty Kraken.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.33,0:09:51.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You bottom feeders don't stand a chance\Nagainst one such as I.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.79,0:09:52.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.83,0:10:00.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,So this was YOUR doing...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.67,0:10:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You shall rue the day...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.50,0:10:06.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,you dared lay a tentacle on me!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.13,0:10:07.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh squid!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.21,0:10:13.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dragon Breath!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.25,0:10:19.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, take it easy!\NYou'll blast the others too!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.17,0:10:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,IT BURNS!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.17,0:10:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's finawwy over...
