Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.38,0:10:44.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Laika wanted calamari...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.29,0:10:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why isn't there anything to eat?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.25,0:10:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's your fault!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.54,0:10:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, human. Hang in there.
